<p>Therefore <code>=CE=A3</code> currently replays judge results, not the a=
ctual committed transition.</p>

Fix
<p>Replay must run a pinned pure transition program:</p>

<code>(state_before, claim, actuality, gates, authority, proposal)
    -&gt; state_after
</code>
<p>and recompute the exact state root.</p>



1.7 QP signature is not verified
<p>Receipt contains:</p>

<code>qp_signer
