<p>but replay does not verify either.</p>
<p>So an unsigned receipt with empty signature can replay as valid.</p>

Fix
<p>Have a dedicated settlement signing key / KMS identity. Replay verifies =
signer against a trusted QP signer registry and verifies signature over can=
onical receipt hash/domain-separated bytes.</p>
<p>Do not put this key in the connector/executor runtime.</p>



2. <code>qp/judges.ts</code> =E2=80=94 current judges are heuristic probes,=
 not proof-grade judges
<p>Almost every judge relies on regex/string presence instead of exact type=
d claims.</p>
<p>Examples:</p>

<code>judgeDnsValid</code>
<p>TRUE if some evidence contains Cloudflare MX pattern and some evidence c=
