xpected record set, or claim ID.</p>

<code>judgeCfZoneActive</code>
<p>TRUE if a Cloudflare-looking response contains:</p>

<code>&quot;status&quot;:&quot;active&quot;
</code>
<p>It does not prove this is the exact domain/account claimed.</p>

<code>judgeEmailInfrastructure</code>
